---
description: AI Open SDK project conventions
alwaysApply: true
---

This repository contains AI Open SDK, a Business Central AL SDK.

Project layout:

- `apps/AIOpenSDK.Core` contains provider-independent abstractions.
- `apps/AIOpenSDK.ProviderUtils` holds shared Chat Completions helpers for Completions-based providers.
- Provider-specific implementations belong in their respective apps (`AIOpenSDK.Provider.*`).
- Core must not depend on provider implementations.
- No provider app depends on another provider.

Dependency direction (compile order): Core → ProviderUtils → providers → Examples → Test.

When modifying an app:
- inspect its `app.json`
- respect its dependency direction
- preserve existing public APIs unless the task explicitly requires a breaking change
- keep object IDs within the owning app’s `idRanges`

Prefer minimal changes.
Do not introduce abstractions without a concrete use case.

Compile the affected app after implementation when tooling is available.
Tests should pass with the mock provider — no live API key required.
